            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Trending Stocks: TSMC, Beyond Meat, Diageo, Rumble",
            "description": "<p>Shares of Taiwan Semi (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSM\">TSM</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/2330.TW\">2330.TW</a>) are rising despite the chipmaker reporting its slowest growth in eighteen months. Beyond Meat (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BYND\">BYND</a>) finally releases its delayed earnings report after the closing bell today sending its shares higher in the premarket. Guinness and Johnnie Walker maker Diageo's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DGE.L\">DGE.L</a>) London listed shares got a boost after appointing a new CEO. Rumble (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RUM\">RUM</a>) shares are spiking in the premarket too after media reports said that the firm that hosts President Trump's Truth social platform is looking to buy German AI cloud company, Northern Data (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NB2.DE\">NB2.DE</a>). For more live coverage of the markets, watch the full episode of <em>Market Sunrise</em> and visit<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/\"> Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Shares of Taiwan Semi (TSM, 2330.TW) are rising despite the chipmaker reporting its slowest growth in eighteen months. Beyond Meat (BYND) finally releases its delayed earnings report after the closing bell today sending its shares higher in the premarket. Guinness and Johnnie Walker maker Diageo's (DGE.L) London listed shares got a boost after appointing a new CEO. Rumble (RUM) shares are spiking in the premarket too after media reports said that the firm that hosts President Trump's Truth social platform is looking to buy German AI cloud company, Northern Data (NB2.DE). For more live coverage of the markets, watch the full episode of Market Sunrise and visit Yahoo Finance.",
